                        "sense_id": "c8a36369-8a07-3526-868c-cc2f26b4b53f",
                        "entry_id": "1b28882e-8ca6-35e5-bf09-a7d5c8d09010",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A man who is wicked, evil, blasphemous."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53eb2e9f-22af-4868-9610-01fd84d137cb",
                                "sense_id": "c8a36369-8a07-3526-868c-cc2f26b4b53f",
                                "text": "Psalm 36:35, Russian Synodal Bible\n«Видел я нечестивца грозного, расширявшегося, подобно укоренившемуся многоветвистому дереву;-»\n«Videl ja nečestivca groznovo, rasširjavševosja, podobno ukorenivšemusja mnogovetvistomu derevu;-»",
                                "translation": "I saw a gross and wicked blasphemer, flourishing like a deep-rooted and sprawling tree;-”",
                                "english": "I saw a gross and wicked blasphemer, flourishing like a deep-rooted and sprawling tree;-”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
